flowchart LR
    Texts[(Documents)] --> Corpus[Tokenize and index]
    Corpus --> Init[Random topic per token]
    Init --> Gibbs[Collapsed Gibbs sweeps]
    Gibbs <--> Counts[(Topic and document counts)]
    Counts --> Topics[Topic words]
    Counts --> Coherence[UMass coherence]
    Client([Client]) --> Router[HTTP router]
    Router --> Infer[Infer document topics]
    Counts --> Infer
